# Copy this to rules.local.yaml in your project root (not inside this plugin folder).
#
# Two things go here:
#
# 1. Team-added rules — factor 8+ only. Anything reusing a reserved factor 1-7 ID
#    for its stack is discarded by /octocheck-init.
#
#    - { id: PY-8-01, stack: python, factor: 8, factor_name: "Team addition", description: "All API responses must use the shared envelope() helper", severity: medium, engine: llm }
#
# 2. Disabling a core rule that doesn't fit this project — e.g. if inline styles
#    are your deliberate convention and FE-6-01 just adds noise. Reference the
#    existing core rule ID with disabled: true; no other fields needed. Disabling
#    is per-project (this file), never edits rules.core.yaml itself, and shows up
#    in the report header as "N core rules disabled for this project" so it's
#    visible, not silent.
#
#    - { id: FE-6-01, disabled: true }

[]
